"description":"Paste remembers everything you copy — text, links, images, files — on Mac, iPhone, and iPad. So the thing you copied yesterday, last week, or last month is always one shortcut away.\n\nTrusted for 10 years by designers, developers, writers, lawyers, and support teams. Recognized by Apple as an \"invaluable utility.\"\n\nNEVER LOSE A COPY AGAIN\nYour clipboard normally holds one item. Paste holds them all.\n– Unlimited clipboard history across all your devices\n– Clear visual previews — see exactly what you copied, and where it came from\n– Rules that automatically skip passwords and other sensitive content\n\nFIND ANYTHING IN SECONDS\n– Search everything you've ever copied — even text inside screenshots and photos\n– Filter by app, date, device, or content type\n– Jump straight from a search result to its place in your history\n\nPASTE AT THE SPEED OF THOUGHT\n– Open Paste in any app with a single shortcut\n– Paste recent items instantly with ⌘1–9\n– Queue items in Paste Stack and paste them in order — perfect for forms and repetitive work\n– Paste as plain text whenever you want formatting gone\n\nEVERYWHERE YOU WORK\n– iCloud sync keeps Mac, iPhone, and iPad perfectly in step\n– Hand off items between devices mid-task\n– On iOS: the Paste Keyboard brings your whole history into any app\n– Works seamlessly alongside Universal Clipboard\n\nORGANIZE AND COLLABORATE\n– Keep the important stuff on Pinboards — snippets, templates, and assets that never expire\n– Share Pinboards with your team, family, or clients\n– You decide who can view and who can edit\n\nWORKS WITH YOUR AI TOOLS\n– Connect your clipboard history to Claude, Cursor, and other AI assistants with built-in MCP support (Mac)\n– Polish copied text with Apple Intelligence Writing Tools\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\n– Your data lives on your devices and in your private iCloud — never on our servers\n– Hide Paste from screen sharing and recordings\n– Pause capture any time\n\nTry Paste free for one week. Subscriptions (monthly or annual), a Family plan, and a one-time Lifetime purchase unlock everything on Mac, iPhone, and iPad.\n\n\"I don't know how I lived without it\" — the thing users tell us most. Copy something. You'll see.\n\nLearn more: pasteapp.io\nSay hello: pasteapp.io/contact or @paste_app on X\nTerms: pasteapp.io/terms", "sellerUrl":"https://pasteapp.io/?utm_source=appstore&utm_medium=appstore", "averageUserRating":4.20399000000000011567635738174431025981903076171875, "trackCensoredName":"Paste – Limitless Clipboard", "languageCodesISO2A":["CS", "DA", "NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "HE", "IT", "JA", "KO", "PL", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "ES", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"165673984", "formattedPrice":"Free", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1353, "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/paste-limitless-clipboard/id967805235?uo=4", "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.20399000000000011567635738174431025981903076171875, "bundleId":"com.wiheads.paste", "sellerName":"Paste Team", "minimumOsVersion":"26.0", 
